<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-018" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang" source-id="s-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:commission" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">請琅邪<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:commission:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">王祥</persName>為別駕，民事一以委之，世多其能任賢。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:miscellany" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:miscellany:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:miscellany:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">休徵</persName>。性至孝，後母苛虐，每欲危害<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:miscellany:m0018" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:miscellany:m0020" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>色養無怠。盛寒之月，後母曰：「吾思食生魚。」<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:miscellany:m0043" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>脫衣，將剖冰求之，（有）少，堅冰解，下有魚躍出，因奉以供，時人以為孝感之所致也。供養三十餘年，母終乃仕，以淳誠貞粹見重於時。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:career" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:career:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>始出仕，年過五十矣，稍遷至司隸校尉。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:career:m0019" ref="d6b_ea7_928">高貴鄉公</persName>入學，以<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:career:m0027" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>為三老，遷司空太尉。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:career:m0038" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI">司馬文王</persName>初為晉王，司空<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:career:m0049" ref="yoo_ox0_545_BAA">荀顗</persName>要<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:career:m0052" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>盡敬，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:career:m0056" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>不從。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:death:m0000" ref="hgm_jvn_hle">晉武</persName>踐阼，拜<persName id="c-sanguozhi-018-jin033-wangxiang:death:m0006" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AA">祥</persName>為太保，封雎陵公。泰始四年，年八十九薨。</p>
</text>
